## How it works

```text
                  analog voltage                 USB serial, 9600 baud
   LM35  ───────────────────────►  Arduino Uno  ─────────────────────────►  LabVIEW (PC)
 (10 mV/°C)                         A0, 10-bit ADC     "68\r\n" per line      read, convert, filter,
                                         ▲                                    compare, log
                                         │       '1' = alarm ON, '0' = OFF       │
                                         └───────────────────────────────────────┘
                                         drives buzzer (D8) and LED (D7)
